Quiet Discoveries

Quiet Discoveries is a modified version of Shy Safari by teacherdotdev
(teacher.dev), https://github.com/teacherdotdev/shy-safari, which is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE.txt).

Changes from the original include renaming the app to Quiet Discoveries,
rewording its copy (the creatures are called "QDs"), and removing the
original project's branding, web analytics and hosting configuration.
